  "decision_conditions": [
    "Without evidence to the contrary, the application has failed to provide evidence that the proposal will provide a satisfactory reduction in carbon emissions, a SuDS strategy meet the Council's minimum requirements and water efficiency measures. As such, the application would be contrary to Policies SI 2 and S1 12 of the London Plan 2021 and Policies 31, 32 and 33 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018.",
    "The proposed development is considered unacceptable in terms of the lack of a completed S106 agreement, in regards to biodiversity monitoring and self build status, as such the application would be contrary to Policy G6 of the London Plan 2021 and Policy 26 of the Sutton Local Plan 2019.\r",
    "In the absence of evidence to indicate otherwise, the applicant has failed to demonstrate that the proposed development would conserve or enhance biodiversity within this site. As such, the proposed development is contrary to Schedule 7A of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as inserted by Schedule 14 of the Environment Act 2021)."
  ],
